# Per-operator YAML manifests carry identity material (email, name) — never commit.
# Schema + example + validator + README + roster ARE committed.
#
# `*.yml` has no slash, so it matches recursively: per-env manifests under
# ops/operators/<env>/<handle>.yml (e.g. zagros/user147x.yml) are
# ignored too. Per-env folders may carry a committed README.md (no identity
# material) documenting the env; that is allowed by the !*/README.md rule.
*.yml
!example.yml.example
# Revoke integration-test fixtures carry no identity material — committed.
!test-revoke/test-overrides.yml
# Allow schema dir
!schema/
# Per-env folder docs are committable (no identity material).
!*/README.md
# Validator + README committed by their own paths
out/
# Phase 6 audit log carries operator identity per row — never commit
audit.log
